3. Runtime-only third-party services (not redistributed)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   These are called on demand at runtime. No content from them is stored in
   this repository or shipped with the application.

   dictionaryapi.dev -- supplies English definitions when a word is missing
     from the bundled data. Its English definitions come largely from
     Wiktionary and are licensed CC BY-SA 3.0
     (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). Results are cached
     in the end user's browser only. Because nothing from this source is
     bundled or redistributed, CC BY-SA's share-alike terms do not reach
     this repository's own code or data.

   Cloudflare Workers AI -- performs server-side translation behind
     /api/translate.

   OCR.Space -- performs image text recognition behind /api/ocr.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. This project's own content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   The following are original to this project and are covered by the Apache
   License 2.0 in LICENSE:

   - Application code: src/, worker/, tools/, tests/
   - Classroom phrasebook and multi-word phrase layer, including their
     Chinese meanings, plain-English glosses and example sentences:
     tools/lexicon-data/phrase-lexicon.json,
     public/assets/lexicon/phrase-lexicon.json,
     public/assets/phrasebook.json (authored inline in
     tools/generate-phrasebook.mjs)
   - Curated phonetic hints: public/assets/phonetics.json
   - Curated classroom word entries authored directly in
     tools/build-core-lexicon.mjs and tools/required-core-words.json
   - Learning bands (foundation / developing / expanding). These are this
     project's own ordering for teaching purposes and are not a school
     grade standard or any examination certification.
   - Images and icons: public/favicon.ico, public/favicon.png,
     public/assets/logo.png, public/assets/logo-64.webp,
     public/assets/logo-128.webp, public/assets/lucia-160.webp,
     public/assets/lucia-320.webp, public/assets/monkey-80.webp,
     public/assets/monkey-160.webp
   - Fonts: none are bundled. The interface uses system font stacks only.

   public/assets/dict.json is a small legacy fallback glossary that predates
   the build pipeline above. Its entries are short child-level single
   glosses and carry none of ECDICT's phonetic markers; no third-party
   source for it is recorded in this repository's history.

